 ₹37 Cr. The possession date of the property is Dec '27. Occupying 29 floor, the flat offers carpet area 2762 sqft. This residence offers power back up, reserved parking, security, service/goods lift, visitor parking, intercom facility, ro water system. The project is RERA approved and P51900045295 is the RERA number of the society. Properties in Kalpataru Azuro are priced between ₹34.27 Cr - ₹54.20 Cr, available in 4,5 bhk flats options.\n\nRead more\n\n₹37 Cr \n\n₹1,11,648 per sqft \n\nContact Agent Get Phone No.\n\nCertified Agent\n\nR\n\nRuchika Shelters\n\n2500+ Buyers Served\n\n20+ Photos\n\n![Image 1: 4BHK Multistorey Apartment for New Property in Dhuleva Seven at Babulnath](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/ver2/XIwvQlc61t8ZIpanz4mAnjVE88E9dMvh3cMnmv-NNX5D6j7-0m8f/Photo_h470_w1080/82364263_1_PropertyImage1764591322750_470_1080.jpg)\n\n![Image 2: 4BHK Multistorey Apartment for New Property in Dhuleva Seven at Babulnath](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/ver2/XIwvQlc61t8ZIpanz4mAnjVE88E9dMvh3cMnmv-NNX5D6j7-0m8f/Photo_h470_w1080/82364263_2_PropertyImage1764591354028_470_1080.jpg)\n\n![Image 3: 4BHK Multistorey Apartment for New Property in Dhuleva Seven at Babulnath](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/ver2/XIwvQlc61t8ZIpanz4mAnjVE88E9dMvh3cMnmv-NNX5D6j7-0m8f/Photo_h470_w1080/82364263_3_PropertyImage1764591379418_470_1080.jpg)\n\n![Image 4: 4BHK Multistorey Apartment for New Property in Dhuleva Seven at Babulnath](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/ver2/XIwvQlc61t8ZIpanz4mAnjVE88E9dMvh3cMnmv-NNX5D6j7-0m8f/Photo_h470_w1080/82364263_6_PropertyImage1764591625252_470_1080.jpg)\n\n![Image 5: 4BHK Multistorey Apartment for New Property in Dhuleva Seven at Babulnath](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/ver2/XIwvQlc61t8ZIpanz4mAnjVE88E9dMvh3cMnmv-NNX5D6j7-0m8f/Photo_h470_w1080/82364263_7_PropertyImage1764591639578_470_1080.jpg)\n\n![Image 6: 4BHK Multistorey Ap