nFurnishing\n\nUnfurnished\n\nfacing\n\nWest\n\noverlooking\n\nGarden/Park\n\nOwnership\n\nFreehold\n\nCar Parking\n\n5 Covered\n\nBathroom\n\n7\n\nBalcony\n\n4\n\n*    Visitor Parking \n*    Bar/Lounge \n*    Private pool  \n*    Power Back Up \n\nexclusive 5 bhk duplex with a great view. please get in touch for more details. the best new building in malabar hill \n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai has an attractive 6 BHK apartment for sale.This 6 BHK flat on sale is bundled with well-designed 5 covered car parking space for the comfort of the residents. You can buy this ready to move flat in Malabar Hill at price of ₹82 Cr. Positioned on 16 floor, the property spans carpet area 5500 sqft. This property is equipped with power back up, reserved parking, visitor parking.\n\nRead more\n\n₹82 Cr \n\n₹91,111 per sqft \n\nGet Phone No.Contact Agent\n\nAgent: Raheja Property Consultants\n\nOperating Since: 1990\n\n8500+ Buyers Served\n\n3+ Photos\n\n![Image 1: 6 BHK Flat in Runwal Malabar in Malabar Hill](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/ver2/XIwvQlc61t8ZIpanz4mAnTVB48U9dswwvk-lhLmjWpryRtHFS-H2/Photo_h470_w1080/84710207_5_allivingroom_470_1080.jpg)\n\n![Image 2: 6 BHK Flat in Runwal Malabar in Malabar Hill](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/ver2/XIwvQlc61t8ZIpanz4mAnTVB48U9dswwvk-lhLmjWpryRtHFS-H2/Photo_h470_w1080/84710207_3_albed1_470_1080.jpg)\n\n![Image 3: 6 BHK Flat in Runwal Malabar in Malabar Hill](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/ver2/XIwvQlc61t8ZIpanz4mAnTVB48U9dswwvk-lhLmjWpryRtHFS-H2/Photo_h470_w1080/84710207_2_albarthroom_470_1080.jpg)\n\nPosted: Jul 19, '26\n\n*   [Share Feedback](javascript:void(0))\n\n## 6 BHK Flat for Sale in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n(Kemps Corner)\n\n[Runwal Malabar](https://www.magicbricks.com/runwal-malabar-kemps-corner-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343435353935)\n\nCarpet Area\n\n5000 sqft\n\nUnder Construction\n\nPoss. by Dec '32\n\nFloor\n\n32 out of 38\n\nTransaction\n\nNew Property\n\n