Projects](/buy/real-estate-mumbai?_l=1ec73c8c-7cc1-45ea-994b-fabd5e7c0ea0)\n\nFind your dream home today!\n\nCall us Toll Free\n\n[+91 8080 190190](tel:+918080190190)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/4-bhk-flats-in-malabar-hill-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs","title":"4 BHK Flats in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - 57+ 4 BHK Flats for Sale in Malabar Hill, Mumbai","raw_content":"# 4 BHK Flats in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![Buy 4 BHK Flat in Malabar Hill Mumbai](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h310_w462/2024/12/23/Project-Photo-4-Kalpataru-Prive-Mumbai-5355857_578_661_310_462.jpg \"Buy 4 BHK Flat in Malabar Hill Mumbai\")\n\n## 4 BHK Flat for Sale in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nMultistorey Apartment for Sale in Malabar Hill, Mumbai. Covered area is 10729.0 Sq-ft. This property belongs to \"Kalpataru Prive\" .   \n  \nThis 4 BHK flat is in Malabar Hill, Mumbai.It has an excellent location within Kalpataru Prive. This oct '27 flat located in Malabar Hill is available at the price of ₹129.92 Cr. The possession date of the property is Oct '27. The project is RERA approved and P51900047321 is the RERA number of the society. The pricing in Kalpataru Prive varies from ₹32.47 Cr - ₹129.92 Cr, offering units in 4,7 bhk flats configurations. The address of this beautiful 4 BHK apartment is Alatamont Road, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharshtra.   [View Property](/propertyDetails/4-BHK-10729-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Malabar-Hill-in-Mumbai&id=4d423835393238363933)\n\n![Buy 4 BHK Flat in Malabar Hill Mumbai](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h310_w462/2024/12/23/Project-Photo-5-Kalpataru-Prive-Mumbai-5355857_473_663_310_462.jpg \"Buy 4 BHK Flat in Malabar Hill Mumbai\")\n\n## 4 BHK Flat for Sale in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nSituated in the prime location of Malabar Hill, the 4 BHK flat is currently available on sale.This well designed apartment is located within Kalpataru Prive. This 4 BHK flat on sale comes with spacious 3 covered car parking; all desig